CANDIDATE_C.raw_generation:
NUMBER n.
INPUT(n).
NUMBER count = 0.
LOOP (NUMBER i = 1 TILL i <= n, i++) {
    IF (i % 2 == 0 AND i % 5 != 0 OR i % 2 != 0 AND i % 5 == 0) {
        count += 1.
    }
}
DISPLAYNL(count).

